   [C] AGE-READER-CAND with a family WORSE or U HIGHER: the model's reading of its own rolled history costs at 2.0 s too; the AGE read is then the acceptance check for the training line of recommendation C: an arm trained on its own rolled history must read NOT-SEPARATED or BETTER on every family and U NOT-SEPARATED or LOWER where the line models read WORSE or HIGHER here
